module Core

### Represents the protocol for in-place true division.
### `InPlaceDivisible` is for mutable numeric values whose division surface
### updates the current value with the computed quotient.
protocol InPlaceDivisible
  ### Divides this value by `you` in place.
  ### :param you: The divisor.
  ### :note: The right-hand operand should remain unchanged.
  @writable
  routine Me.$itruediv(you: Me)
